# The pictures of 33-app-guidelines.md §1.3 (scripts/guideline-shots.sh runs
# this with the sample as the developer's app, in each language): the steps
# wait for screens by id, or for text that is the same in every language, so
# one script serves all; the clock is set so that the pictures do not change.
sleep 800
at sys.idle 5000
type /
type Guidelines
key enter
at com.example.guidelines/main

== 33 每个功能在「选项」菜单里都找得到
nfc clock 09:41
fill menu-do
key enter
at com.example.guidelines/menu-do
key tab
sleep 300
snap menu-do
key esc
key esc
fill menu-dont
key enter
at com.example.guidelines/menu-dont
key tab
sleep 300
snap menu-dont
key esc
key esc

== 33 删除在菜单里，不是每一项后面一个按钮
nfc clock 09:41
fill list-do
key enter
at com.example.guidelines/list-do
snap list-do
key esc
fill list-dont
key enter
at com.example.guidelines/list-dont
snap list-dont
key esc

== 33 输入框加 submit，不另放「确定」按钮
nfc clock 09:41
fill input-do
key enter
at com.example.guidelines/input-do
snap input-do
key esc
fill input-dont
key enter
at com.example.guidelines/input-dont
snap input-dont
key esc

== 33 状态用样式，不用表情和字符画
nfc clock 09:41
fill status-do
key enter
at com.example.guidelines/status-do
snap status-do
key esc
fill status-dont
key enter
at com.example.guidelines/status-dont
snap status-dont
key esc

== 33 付款用系统的可信确认，不自己画密码键盘
nfc clock 09:41
fill pay-do
key enter
at com.example.guidelines/pay-do
key enter
wait com.example.guide
snap pay-do
key esc
sleep 500
key esc
fill pay-dont
key enter
at com.example.guidelines/pay-dont
snap pay-dont
key esc
